      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Milford%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Milford was incorporated on March 3, 1874, becoming an official village in Iroquois County.",
