        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://publish.illinois.edu/ihlc-blog/2019/12/29/life-in-milford-the-harry-s-frame-photographs-memorabilia-and-papers/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Illinois Route 1 runs through Milford, linking it 12 miles north to Watseka and 12 miles south to Hoopeston.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
